OL,3,GNEWSAFaster rural broadband rollout
OL,4,A'not quick enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor photographer Lisa Daniels, the
OL,7,Frollout of faster broadband to
OL,8,Fthousands of people in rural areas of
OL,9,FDerbyshire could not come soon enough.
OL,11,FProject Gigabit is the government's
OL,12,Fprogramme to enable hard-to-reach
OL,13,Fcommunities to access "lightning-fast"
OL,14,Fgigabit-capable broadband.
OL,16,FThe rollout has reached halfway, with
OL,17,F6,600 homes and businesses already
OL,18,Fconnected in the county, said the
OL,19,FDepartment for Digital, Culture, Media
OL,20,Fand Sport (DCMS).
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
