OL,3,GNEWSAFaster rural broadband rollout
OL,4,A'not quick enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaniels, who lives in the Peak District
OL,7,Fvillage of Edale, said the government
OL,8,Fhad been promising for a long time that
OL,9,Fit would cover small pockets of
OL,10,Fisolated areas with little internet,
OL,11,Fbut it was "not fulfilling its promise
OL,12,Fquick enough".
